Subject: [PATCH] telnet: fix -Wextra implicit-fallthrough

Words after "fall through" break the =3 comment regex;
split the explanation from the canonical /* fall through */ marker.
diff --git a/networking/telnet.c b/networking/telnet.c
index 7a02535..0153d0e 100644
--- a/networking/telnet.c
+++ b/networking/telnet.c
@@ -295,7 +295,8 @@ static void handle_net_input(int len)
 			G.telstate = TS_COPY;
 			if (c == '\0')
 				break;
-			/* else: fall through - need to handle CR IAC ... properly */
+			/* else: need to handle CR IAC ... properly */
+			/* fall through */
 
 		case TS_COPY: /* Prev char was ordinary */
 			/* Similar to NORMAL, but in TS_COPY we need to copy bytes */
